    {
        "id": "sea-and-sky_npcc_lantern",
        "name": "Lantern",
        "role": "support",
        "info": {
            "flavor": "For centuries, folktales on Maguayan have warned of pale spirits that roam the wilderness, cursing those who trespass on their territory with ill fortune. These stories, once dismissed by outsiders as the superstition of a backwater planet, have only grown more vivid and widespread with time. Theorists agree the mysterious entities must be paracausal in nature, but more specific conclusions require further data.",
            "tactics": "The Lantern is a highly mobile support that makes nearby enemies easier to attack and liable to taking additional damage. It can mark an individual character with a targetable shadow that effectively increases their hurtbox, denying them cover. Lanterns can close distance easily but pose little threat on their own; they work best with allies that can reliably output damage and keep them alive."
        },
