    {
        "id": "sea-and-sky_npcc_reaper",
        "name": "Reaper",
        "role": "defender",
        "info": {
            "flavor": "Makaptan's blackwash wranglers are known for their bravado, but there are those notorious few who actively cultivate a menacing aura. These self-styled \"reapers\" flaunt their mastery over nanites by wielding them in combat, and many moonlight as mercenaries in addition to their usual wrangling gigs. The psychological threat of being consumed by greywash is by itself often enough to erode even the most experienced pilot's composure.",
            "tactics": "Reapers are melee defenders that use their signature debuff, Frightened, to force nearby enemies to pay attention to them or suffer debilitating effects. Though strong against stationary and grouped opponents, Reapers are slow for their short range and benefit from allies that provide reliable damage, mobility, and ways to deal with long-range attackers."
        },
